UID:10002877-1780646400-1780678800@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Live Music & Food Truck at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Friday\, June 5 | 5–8 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick off your weekend Great Bear style with an evening of great wine\, live music\, and delicious food in the vineyard! \nSettle in with a glass of our estate-grown wine  and enjoy the smooth sounds of Two Alley Town \, a talented local jazz combo bringing together beloved jazz standards\, soft rock favorites\, and blues classics. Their laid-back style creates the perfect soundtrack for a relaxing Friday evening among the vines.\nCome hungry!  We’re excited to welcome Buenos Aires Grill back to the winery. Serving authentic Argentinian cuisine \, they’ll be offering their crowd-favorite empanadas  along with flavorful steak and chicken sandwiches. Please help us support this fantastic local business by enjoying dinner from the food truck and leaving outside food at home.\nGather your friends\, grab a glass of wine\, and enjoy a beautiful summer evening filled with music\, great food\, and vineyard views.  We can’t wait to see you there!\n About Two Alley TownTwo Alley Town is a small jazz combo featuring longtime local musicians Jim Hilliard on bass and trombone\, John Rominger on keyboard and vocals\, and guest vocalist Staci Montgomery. Their mix of jazz standards\, soft rock\, and blues favorites appeals to music lovers of all ages.\n About Buenos Aires GrillBuenos Aires Grill serves authentic Argentinian cuisine with a menu featuring handmade empanadas\, steak sandwiches\, and chicken sandwiches that pair perfectly with Great Bear wines.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-food-truck-at-great-bear-vineyards/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
